CC road freight, typically 1 to 2 weeks door-to-door to Riyadh or Jeddah including customs. Giga-project sites are supplied through project logistics with staged deliveries and on-site storage planning.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Are your products compliant for the Saudi market?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Shipments are prepared with SABER/SASO conformity documentation required for Saudi customs clearance. Our team manages the certification paperwork so consignments clear without delays.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can you support Riyadh Season-scale event installations?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes — our Riyadh Season main-stage build used rapid-rigging modular panels with broadcast-grade refresh rates. We support festival and event contractors with rental-spec panels, flight-cased logistics and on-site engineering.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do you work with Saudi contractors and consultants?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes — we regularly work as the LED specialist under Saudi main contractors, providing shop drawings, structural loads, power schedules and ICC-ready documentation for consultant approval.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What warranty and support do you offer in Saudi Arabia?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Installations include a 2-year warranty extendable to 5 years, with spare modules quoted into every project so repairs happen on site without waiting for imports. Remote diagnostics plus scheduled maintenance visits cover Riyadh, Jeddah and the Eastern Province.\\\"}}]}9:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"WebPage\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LED Displays Saudi Arabia | Brightluxx Market Leaders\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Explore premium LED displays in Saudi Arabia with Brightluxx. Superior quality \\u0026 service for your display needs. Contact us now!\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/saudi-arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"publisher\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\\\\\"}}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 2, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LED Displays Saudi Arabia | Brightluxx Market Leaders\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/saudi-arabia\\\\\\\"}]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"legalName\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"contactPoint\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ContactPoint\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"contactType\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"sales\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"SA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"QA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"KW\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"BH\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"OM\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"availableLanguage\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\"]}}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$13\\\"}}]],\\\"$L14\\\"]}]\\n15:Tcaa,\\u003ch1\\u003eLED Displays Saudi Arabia | Brightluxx Market Leaders\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eExplore premium LED displays in Saudi Arabia with Brightluxx. Superior quality \\u0026amp; service for your display needs. Contact us now!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eSaudi Arabia Areas We Serve\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRiyadh — KAFD \\u0026amp; Olaya\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Financial-district towers, giga-project showrooms and Boulevard entertainment zones.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eJeddah — Tahlia \\u0026amp; Corniche\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Retail flagships, hospitality and waterfront advertising screens.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDammam \\u0026amp; Khobar\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Eastern Province corporate, energy-sector and mall installations.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eNEOM \\u0026amp; Giga-Projects\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Staged project logistics and specification support for developer and contractor teams.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMakkah \\u0026amp; Madinah\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Hospitality towers and wayfinding displays for pilgrim-facing venues.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eSaudi Arabia Signage Regulations \\u0026amp; Power\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eBaladiya Advertising Licence\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOutdoor screens in Saudi cities are licensed by the local municipality (Baladiya) with structural and content conditions. We prepare drawings and load calculations for your submission.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eSASO / SABER Conformity\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eImports clear Saudi customs under SABER certificates of conformity — we manage the certification paperwork on every shipment.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eSEC Power Coordination\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLarge screens require approved electrical loads with the Saudi Electricity Company; we issue load schedules and work with your contractor.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eSaudi Arabia Project Highlights\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eRiyadh Season Main Stage\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBoulevard Riyadh City — High-brightness modular stage LED for one of the region's largest entertainment festivals, built for rapid rigging and broadcast-grade refresh.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eLED Display FAQs — Saudi Arabia\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDo you deliver LED screens to Riyadh, Jeddah and NEOM?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — we deliver across the Kingdom by GCC road freight, typically 1 to 2 weeks door-to-door to Riyadh or Jeddah including customs. Giga-project sites are supplied through project logistics with staged deliveries and on-site storage planning.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eAre your products compliant for the Saudi market?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eShipments are prepared with SABER/SASO conformity documentation required for Saudi customs clearance. Our team manages the certification paperwork so consignments clear without delays.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCan you support Riyadh Season-scale event installations?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — our Riyadh Season main-stage build used rapid-rigging modular panels with broadcast-grade refresh rates. We support festival and event contractors with rental-spec panels, flight-cased logistics and on-site engineering.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDo you work with Saudi contractors and consultants?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — we regularly work as the LED specialist under Saudi main contractors, providing shop drawings, structural loads, power schedules and ICC-ready documentation for consultant approval.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat warranty and support do you offer in Saudi Arabia?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eInstallations include a 2-year warranty extendable to 5 years, with spare modules quoted into every project so repairs happen on site without waiting for imports. Remote diagnostics plus scheduled maintenance visits cover Riyadh, Jeddah and the Eastern Province.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"LED Displays Saudi Arabia | Brightluxx Market Leaders\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Explore premium LED displays in Saudi Arabia with Brightluxx. Superior quality \\u0026 service for your display needs. Contact us now!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/saudi-arabia\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n4:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[220