nswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — we regularly work as the LED specialist under Saudi main contractors, providing shop drawings, structural loads, power schedules and ICC-ready documentation for consultant approval.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What warranty and support do you offer in Saudi Arabia?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Installations include a 2-year warranty extendable to 5 years, with spare modules quoted into every project so repairs happen on site without waiting for imports. Remote diagnostics plus scheduled maintenance visits cover Riyadh, Jeddah and the Eastern Province.\"}}]}9:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"WebPage\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"LED Displays Saudi Arabia | Brightluxx Market Leaders\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Explore premium LED displays in Saudi Arabia with Brightluxx. Superior quality & service for your display needs. Contact us now!\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/saudi-arabia\\\", \\\"publisher\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"LED Displays Saudi Arabia | Brightluxx Market Leaders\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/saudi-arabia\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$13\"}}]],\"$L14\"]}]\n15:Tcaa,<h1>LED Displays Saudi Arabia | Brightluxx Market Leaders</h1><p>Explore premium LED displays in Saudi Arabia with Brightluxx. Superior quality &amp; service for your display needs. Contact us now!</p><h2>Saudi Arabia Areas We Serve</h2><ul><li><strong>Riyadh — KAFD &amp; Olaya</strong>: Financial-district towers, giga-project showrooms and Boulevard entertainment zones.</li><li><strong>Jeddah — Tahlia &amp; Corniche</strong>: Retail flagships, hospitality and waterfront advertising screens.</li><li><strong>Dammam &amp; Khobar</strong>: Eastern Province corporate, energy-sector and mall installations.</li><li><strong>NEOM &amp; Giga-Projects</strong>: Staged project logistics and specification support for developer and contractor teams.</li><li><strong>Makkah &amp; Madinah</strong>: Hospitality towers and wayfinding displays for pilgrim-facing venues.</li></ul><h2>Saudi Arabia Signage Regulations &amp; Power</h2><h3>Baladiya Advertising Licence</h3><p>Outdoor screens in Saudi cities are licensed by the local municipality (Baladiya) with structural and content conditions. We prepare drawings and load calculations for your submission.</p><h3>SASO / SABER Conformity</h3><p>Imports clear Saudi customs under SABER certificates of conformity — we manage the certification paperwork on every shipment.</p><h3>SEC Power Coordination</h3><p>Large screens require approved electrical loads with the Saudi Electricity Company; we issue load schedules and work with your contractor.</p><h2>Saudi Arabia Project Highlights</h2><h3>Riyadh Season Main Stage</h3><p>Boulevard Riyadh City — High-brightness modular stage LED for one of the region's largest entertainment festivals, built for rapid rigging and broadcast-grade refresh.</p><h2>LED Display FAQs — Saudi Arabia</h2><h3>Do you deliver LED screens to Riyadh, Jeddah and NEOM?</h3><p>Yes — we deliver across the Kingdom by GCC road freight, typically 1 to 2 weeks door-to-door to Riyadh or Jeddah including customs. Giga-project sites are supplied through project logistics with staged deliveries and on-site storage planning.</p><h3>Are your products compliant for the Saudi market?</h3><p>Shipments are prepared with SABER/SASO conformity documentation required for Saudi customs clearance. Our team manages the certification paperwork so consignments clear without delays.</p><h3>Can you support Riyadh Season-scale event installations?</h3><p>Yes — our Riyadh Season main-stage build used rapid-rigging modular panels with broadcast-grade refresh rates. We support festival and event contractors with rental-spec panels, flight-cased logistics and on-site engineering.</p><h3>Do you work with Saudi contractors and consultants?</h3><p>Yes — we regularly work as the LED specialist under Saudi main contractors, providing shop drawings, structural loads, power schedules and ICC-ready documentation for consultant approval.</p><h3>What warranty and support do you offer in Saudi Arabia?</h3><p>Installations include a 2-year warranty extendable to 5 years, with spare modules quoted into every project so repairs happen on site without waiting for imports. Remote diagnostics plus scheduled maintenance visits cover Riyadh, Jeddah and the Eastern Province.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nf:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nc:null\n11:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"LED Displays Saudi Arabia | Brightluxx Market Leaders\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Explore premium LED displays in S